Subject: Restore original task and movie compilation with native ABI interfaces
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Original tasks, frontend provider, movie/handler and THPSimple bodies compile
as complete units. Legacy borrowed-task checks, absent-service stops and movie
observers stay diagnostics. Guard Wii object-size assertions, retain the actual
cSAnim::Destroy declaration, use the canonical u64/strstr/SDK declarations and
full-width event owner pointers. Preserve movie material Instance/lifetime and
original texture APIs outside explicit diagnostics. This compiler/source gate
is not a full game link, THPSimple data ABI/audio qualification or scene render.
GXWaitDrawDone remains a real native provider to implement, not a success stub.

